  "contentHtml": "<p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">EM(<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">Effective microorganism</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">의 약자</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, '</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">유용한 미생물</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이란 뜻) 만들기를 하였습니다. </span></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">초등학교 때 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">해봤다는 친구들이 없어</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">서인지 더욱 흥미롭게 참여하더군요. </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.   </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">준비물은 간단합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. EM </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">원액과</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">당밀(둘 다 가격 저렴)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">쌀뜨물이 필요한데요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">쌀뜨물은 영양사 선생님께서 준비해 주셨습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">당밀 대신에 설탕을 사용해도 되지만 우리는 당밀을 선택하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아이들은 당밀에서 풍기는 지독하게 단 냄새에 호기심을 보였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">제조방법도 간단해요. 쌀뜨물 1.4L에 당밀 15g 이상을 넣은 후, EM 원액 15mL&nbsp;이상을 넣고 페트병 뚜껑을 꼭 닫고 잘 흔들면 끝입니다.^^ 직사광선을 피한 따뜻한 곳에서 7일~10일 정도 두면(간간이 페트병 흔들기!)&nbsp;발효가 되는데&nbsp;이것을 물과 희석하여 사용합니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">2년 전에는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월에 만들었더니 발효가 안되는 경우도 있어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">올해는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 중 따뜻한 날을 잡았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">덕분에 모두 성공적으로 발효되었고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아이들은 학교의 곳곳</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">화장실 등</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">을 다니면서 희석한 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">EM </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">액을 부었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">좋은 일했다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.’ </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">칭찬하며 시원한 이온음료 한 캔씩을 나누어 주었어요.</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"> EM</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">과 이온음료의 효과를 연관지어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(EM</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">만 주제를 삼아도 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">ok~) </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">과학시화로 표현하며 마무리 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99997D495CD13AB121\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"1.jpg\"  id=\"A_99997D495CD13AB1211EEE\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99AF0F4C5CD13AC331\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"3.jpg\"  id=\"A_99AF0F4C5CD13AC3316F41\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994375435CD13AD32B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"4.jpg\"  id=\"A_994375435CD13AD32B7343\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99096E475CD13AE131\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"5.jpg\"  id=\"A_99096E475CD13AE131E6C2\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99818D4A5CD13AF124\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"6.jpg\"  id=\"A_99818D4A5CD13AF124F329\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B8334E5CD13D1D29\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"7.jpg\"  id=\"A_99B8334E5CD13D1D29DE9A\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}